Description: b1nix live medium and installer
 What turns the b1nix root tree into a live medium and an installer: the
 initramfs boot script that runs the live session from the medium (boot=
 b1nix-live), the live session itself (an automatic root login on the
 console), and b1nix-install, which installs the system onto a disk from the
 console -- asking its questions, or reading them from a file -- and puts
 Limine on it.
 .
 Installed on the live medium only; the installer removes it from the system
 it installs.
